@startuml
title LINGORA - DFD Detail: UC-06 Scenario Writing and Internal GEC
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle Learner
rectangle "5.1 Load Published Scenario" as P51
rectangle "5.2 Validate Bounded English Text" as P52
rectangle "5.3 Internal T5-small Correction" as P53
rectangle "5.4 Deterministic Alignment & Classification" as P54
rectangle "5.5 Render Safe Feedback" as P55
database "D1 ChatScenario + Translation" as Scenarios
database "D2 Model Artifact / Metadata" as Model

Learner --> P51 : scenario selection
P51 --> Scenarios : published scenario query
Scenarios --> P51 : ordered prompt and context
P51 --> Learner : prompt
Learner --> P52 : typed or browser-transcribed text
P52 --> P53 : validated text + scenario code
P53 --> Model : load/use approved checkpoint
Model --> P53 : corrected_text + model metadata
P53 --> P54 : original_text + corrected_text
P54 --> P55 : bounded edits and error types
P55 --> Learner : safe original/corrected diff

note bottom of P53
  Internal Lingora processing component.
  No external AI actor and no primary-data persistence.
end note
@enduml
